.TH "libnvme" 9 "struct nvme_dev_personalities_log" "October 2026" "API Manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
struct nvme_dev_personalities_log \- Device Personalities Log Page (Log Identifier 1Dh)
.SH SYNOPSIS
struct nvme_dev_personalities_log {
.br
.BI "    __le16 nump;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 cdplpv;"
.br
.BI "    __u8 dplphl;"
.br
.BI "    __le16 cdplps;"
.br
.BI "    struct nvme_personality_properties perprops[];"
.br
.BI "
};
.br

.SH Members
.IP "nump" 12
Number of Personalities: number of \fIstruct
nvme_personality_properties\fP entries in \fIperprops\fP. This is a
0's based value.
.IP "cdplpv" 12
CDP Log Page Version
.IP "dplphl" 12
Device Personalities Log Page Header Length
.IP "cdplps" 12
Device Personalities Log Page Size: size of this log page in
bytes.
.IP "perprops" 12
CDP Personality list, listed in ascending order of
Personality Identifier.
